(6607137, 986246, 117534, '<td valign="top">The color and sharpness in this just blows me away! IMHO the crop really hurts this shot. The buff in the dead center bothers me and the rear end on the far left with the head cut off should''ve been cropped out. Holding my hand up and placeing the center Bison cropped at his head and thus putting him in the far left side of the picture is a far more pleasing view. That is the only thing holding this pix from a 10. It is amazeing and so beautiful!</td>', 'The color and sharpness in this just blows me away! IMHO the crop really hurts this shot. The buff in the dead center bothers me and the rear end on the far left with the head cut off should''ve been cropped out. Holding my hand up and placeing the center Bison cropped at his head and thus putting him in the far left side of the picture is a far more pleasing view. That is the only thing holding this pix from a 10. It is amazeing and so beautiful!', '2011-12-01 01:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
