(6607568, 986401, 65234, '<td valign="top">The most interesting part of this to me is the steeple and the sky, so I would have cropped much tighter to make those more dramatic.  It appears to my eye that there are processing artifacts in the sky which would benefit from some blurring and/or noise reduction, and ghosts of things in the parking lot, like 2 images were used and didn''t quite line up.</td>', 'The most interesting part of this to me is the steeple and the sky, so I would have cropped much tighter to make those more dramatic.  It appears to my eye that there are processing artifacts in the sky which would benefit from some blurring and/or noise reduction, and ghosts of things in the parking lot, like 2 images were used and didn''t quite line up.', '2011-12-01 11:16:13.000000', NULL, 1);
