(6608260, 985595, 30982, '<td valign="top">The stylized processing will not sit well with some, but if you like it, then it''s good!  Almost a Harry Potter bird, yes?</td>', 'The stylized processing will not sit well with some, but if you like it, then it''s good!  Almost a Harry Potter bird, yes?', '2011-12-01 22:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
