(6608302, 985290, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost abstractish in a way - great glow of color to contrast the B&amp;W-ness of the water mid-flight.</td>', 'Almost abstractish in a way - great glow of color to contrast the B&W-ness of the water mid-flight.', '2011-12-01 22:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
