(6608304, 985730, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely presentation of the bird - shows him nicely integrated with his environment.</td>', 'Lovely presentation of the bird - shows him nicely integrated with his environment.', '2011-12-01 22:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608305, 986376, 30982, '<td valign="top">I especially like the "Warning - Don''t Photograph".  An odd tableau; fascinating.</td>', 'I especially like the "Warning - Don''t Photograph".  An odd tableau; fascinating.', '2011-12-01 22:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608306, 986076, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely portrait!</td>', 'What a lovely portrait!', '2011-12-01 22:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608307, 986208, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the flare.  A bit too crisp of a processing setting (the halos onthe treeline don''t add to the photograph) but I really like the view.</td>', 'I love the flare.  A bit too crisp of a processing setting (the halos onthe treeline don''t add to the photograph) but I really like the view.', '2011-12-01 22:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608309, 986098, 30982, '<td valign="top">Photographs can be 800 pixels on the longest edge (here, the horizontal dimension).  If you need help sizing photos for entry here, please ask in a forum thread - people will be glad to assist!  Using the full size makes it easier for voters to see and appreciate your pictures.</td>', 'Photographs can be 800 pixels on the longest edge (here, the horizontal dimension).  If you need help sizing photos for entry here, please ask in a forum thread - people will be glad to assist!  Using the full size makes it easier for voters to see and appreciate your pictures.', '2011-12-01 22:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608310, 986342, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very Americana feel - would make a great postcard for the town!</td>', 'Very Americana feel - would make a great postcard for the town!', '2011-12-01 22:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608311, 986271, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cows are very much creatures of habit and follow the same path each day.  Love the variety here, too.</td>', 'Cows are very much creatures of habit and follow the same path each day.  Love the variety here, too.', '2011-12-01 22:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608319, 986151, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how her eyes reflect the colors she''s wearing.</td>', 'I like how her eyes reflect the colors she''s wearing.', '2011-12-01 23:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608321, 986435, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a warm and charming portrait!</td>', 'What a warm and charming portrait!', '2011-12-01 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608322, 985993, 30982, '<td valign="top">This one is gonna be a handful.</td>', 'This one is gonna be a handful.', '2011-12-01 23:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608326, 986291, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really nice energy in this.</td>', 'Really nice energy in this.', '2011-12-01 23:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608327, 986365, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love the title.</td>', 'LOL!  Love the title.', '2011-12-01 23:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608330, 986025, 30982, '<td valign="top">Idyllic and lovely.</td>', 'Idyllic and lovely.', '2011-12-01 23:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608331, 986293, 30982, '<td valign="top">Blimp!  Awesome evening for this.</td>', 'Blimp!  Awesome evening for this.', '2011-12-01 23:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608334, 986201, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gentle light and nice textures.  A few wee bits of sensor dust need to be cloned.</td>', 'Gentle light and nice textures.  A few wee bits of sensor dust need to be cloned.', '2011-12-01 23:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608335, 985012, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely subject to photograph, but unfortunately this is very badly pixelated.  It may be a result of resizing for submission or something from processing.  You can ask for help after the challenge is over if you''re not sure what caused the problem.</td>', 'A lovely subject to photograph, but unfortunately this is very badly pixelated.  It may be a result of resizing for submission or something from processing.  You can ask for help after the challenge is over if you''re not sure what caused the problem.', '2011-12-01 23:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608468, 982901, 108580, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image.</td>', 'Exceptional image.', '2011-12-02 05:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608476, 986332, 25024, '<td valign="top">Love the reflections, though overall there is rather too much in the image, I want to be drawn to the reflections but my eye is constantly dragged away to the tree and the company name above</td>', 'Love the reflections, though overall there is rather too much in the image, I want to be drawn to the reflections but my eye is constantly dragged away to the tree and the company name above', '2011-12-02 05:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608477, 986194, 25024, '<td valign="top">What an amazing natural edifice, I love the trees on top! I like the generally desat feel to the processing</td>', 'What an amazing natural edifice, I love the trees on top! I like the generally desat feel to the processing', '2011-12-02 05:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608478, 985867, 25024, '<td valign="top">A great capture, excellent timing and focus, I like the square composition too.</td>', 'A great capture, excellent timing and focus, I like the square composition too.', '2011-12-02 05:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608479, 986050, 25024, '<td valign="top">Lovely vivid colours of the inner petals and generally good lighting</td>', 'Lovely vivid colours of the inner petals and generally good lighting', '2011-12-02 05:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608481, 984009, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like the fisheye distortion, nice peaceful autumnal scene</td>', 'I like the fisheye distortion, nice peaceful autumnal scene', '2011-12-02 05:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608483, 986182, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette</td>', 'Nice silhouette', '2011-12-02 06:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608496, 985411, 25024, '<td valign="top">A powerful portrait, nicely composed but being constructively critical I think you have overdone the processing on the eyes, obviously intended to draw the viewers attention I think it needs a little more subtlety, other than that a good image</td>', 'A powerful portrait, nicely composed but being constructively critical I think you have overdone the processing on the eyes, obviously intended to draw the viewers attention I think it needs a little more subtlety, other than that a good image', '2011-12-02 06:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608498, 985899, 25024, '<td valign="top">A great image taken in good lighting, I find the bridge somewhat overpowering and would prefer to see the mountain alone or a less powerful natural foreground interest that adds to the image, this manmade structure is for me a contradiction. Nevertheless its still a lovely image, good luck</td>', 'A great image taken in good lighting, I find the bridge somewhat overpowering and would prefer to see the mountain alone or a less powerful natural foreground interest that adds to the image, this manmade structure is for me a contradiction. Nevertheless its still a lovely image, good luck', '2011-12-02 06:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608501, 985684, 25024, '<td valign="top">That looks a lovely old vintage loco, I like your viewpoint that includes the water tower(?) and its lovely script strategically placed above the engine. I am less keen on the coach in the background but the rest of the image is good and works well in mono</td>', 'That looks a lovely old vintage loco, I like your viewpoint that includes the water tower(?) and its lovely script strategically placed above the engine. I am less keen on the coach in the background but the rest of the image is good and works well in mono', '2011-12-02 06:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608502, 986424, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice night time exposure with lovely colours and reflections but I find the wide angle distortion a little off-putting. Such distortion can often be used to very good effect but here I think straightening of both the verticals and horizontals would have improved the image but anyway, good luck</td>', 'Nice night time exposure with lovely colours and reflections but I find the wide angle distortion a little off-putting. Such distortion can often be used to very good effect but here I think straightening of both the verticals and horizontals would have improved the image but anyway, good luck', '2011-12-02 06:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608504, 986305, 25024, '<td valign="top">A nice simple straightforward sort of image, the subdued tones work well here but there is rather a lot of, to be honest, boring uninteresting sky, I think less sky and lore foreground would have improved the composition a lot</td>', 'A nice simple straightforward sort of image, the subdued tones work well here but there is rather a lot of, to be honest, boring uninteresting sky, I think less sky and lore foreground would have improved the composition a lot', '2011-12-02 06:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608517, 986178, 25024, '<td valign="top">A good viewpoint and composition, I have to be honest and say the selective desat has no real appeal I think I would have preferred it straight mono also the clouds may well have been very dark but in the interests of the image overall I think they would benefit from a little lightening. Good luck</td>', 'A good viewpoint and composition, I have to be honest and say the selective desat has no real appeal I think I would have preferred it straight mono also the clouds may well have been very dark but in the interests of the image overall I think they would benefit from a little lightening. Good luck', '2011-12-02 07:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608519, 986252, 25024, '<td valign="top">In yer face! I like it! I love his hang dog expression and those beautiful doleful eyes. I think a shallower DOF would have benefited the rather distracting background, nevertheless a great image, good luck</td>', 'In yer face! I like it! I love his hang dog expression and those beautiful doleful eyes. I think a shallower DOF would have benefited the rather distracting background, nevertheless a great image, good luck', '2011-12-02 07:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608537, 983415, 25024, '<td valign="top">A very calming image taking full advantage of the placid waters, the composition with the three foreground boulders adds more interest, like the seperation between the calm and rougher waters and the land and sky, good image, good luck</td>', 'A very calming image taking full advantage of the placid waters, the composition with the three foreground boulders adds more interest, like the seperation between the calm and rougher waters and the land and sky, good image, good luck', '2011-12-02 07:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608541, 985605, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great slice of life shot.</td>', 'Great slice of life shot.', '2011-12-02 07:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608543, 985649, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the clouds. Nice long exposure.</td>', 'I love the clouds. Nice long exposure.', '2011-12-02 07:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608544, 986252, 23484, '<td valign="top">Kiss me baby!</td>', 'Kiss me baby!', '2011-12-02 07:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608547, 986358, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. I love all the little lines of light.</td>', 'This is excellent. I love all the little lines of light.', '2011-12-02 07:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608548, 986385, 25024, '<td valign="top">A pleasing portrait, good focus and DOF and lighting, I think the catchlights in her eyes would be better if one of them was cloned out to a single light source and clone out the one on her tongue and for me it would improve the image, good luck</td>', 'A pleasing portrait, good focus and DOF and lighting, I think the catchlights in her eyes would be better if one of them was cloned out to a single light source and clone out the one on her tongue and for me it would improve the image, good luck', '2011-12-02 07:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608550, 986288, 23484, '<td valign="top">The slight layer of mist kind of illuminates the horses.</td>', 'The slight layer of mist kind of illuminates the horses.', '2011-12-02 07:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608551, 986383, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice light on white.</td>', 'Nice light on white.', '2011-12-02 07:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608553, 986281, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Love the symetry.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Love the symetry.', '2011-12-02 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608554, 985294, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and processing.10</td>', 'Excellent capture and processing.10', '2011-12-02 07:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608555, 986273, 23484, '<td valign="top">The color tone is excellent. Love the curved lane.</td>', 'The color tone is excellent. Love the curved lane.', '2011-12-02 07:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608557, 985301, 25024, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, I like the way you have cropped the coffee one, its taken me several moments to see the coffee bean background, sorry. This would make a good adverising shot with the message ''I love coffee''  I hope that is what you are trying to portray? What I think I would have done would be to replace the yellow of the rose with a shade nearer those of the crockery.</td>', 'Interesting image, I like the way you have cropped the coffee one, its taken me several moments to see the coffee bean background, sorry. This would make a good adverising shot with the message ''I love coffee''  I hope that is what you are trying to portray? What I think I would have done would be to replace the yellow of the rose with a shade nearer those of the crockery.', '2011-12-02 07:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608559, 986266, 25024, '<td valign="top">A lovely interesting ceiling with nice subtle colouring but for me it is dominated by the ceiling light and to be most effective it could benefit from more symmetry, good luck</td>', 'A lovely interesting ceiling with nice subtle colouring but for me it is dominated by the ceiling light and to be most effective it could benefit from more symmetry, good luck', '2011-12-02 07:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608560, 986186, 25024, '<td valign="top">Although your subject strikes a soewhat awkward pose it adds some dynamics into the image. Works well in mono though I think the shade of the lighting is darkening down what ought to be a bright sunny winter image</td>', 'Although your subject strikes a soewhat awkward pose it adds some dynamics into the image. Works well in mono though I think the shade of the lighting is darkening down what ought to be a bright sunny winter image', '2011-12-02 07:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608562, 986043, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the sunlit branch on the floor with the silhouette of the tree though I think perhaps half a stop or so of brightening would help bring out more detail</td>', 'I like the contrast of the sunlit branch on the floor with the silhouette of the tree though I think perhaps half a stop or so of brightening would help bring out more detail', '2011-12-02 07:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608563, 983499, 25024, '<td valign="top">Its good to try for different poses to create something unique but I have to say I find this image rather disconcerting also I think the highlight on her nose could benefit from toning down a little</td>', 'Its good to try for different poses to create something unique but I have to say I find this image rather disconcerting also I think the highlight on her nose could benefit from toning down a little', '2011-12-02 07:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608564, 984978, 25024, '<td valign="top">Ok, I love this great abstract but I can imagine there will be many who don''t, I wish you well with it</td>', 'Ok, I love this great abstract but I can imagine there will be many who don''t, I wish you well with it', '2011-12-02 07:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608567, 984614, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very effective and appealing, good lighting, you''ve done an excellent job of this</td>', 'Very effective and appealing, good lighting, you''ve done an excellent job of this', '2011-12-02 08:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608570, 986345, 25024, '<td valign="top">An amazing sky which I have no doubt will appeal to many here much more than myself but I have to give you full credit for the lovely reflections, good luck</td>', 'An amazing sky which I have no doubt will appeal to many here much more than myself but I have to give you full credit for the lovely reflections, good luck', '2011-12-02 08:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608573, 986172, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good action capture but it would have so much more impact if the focus was at the plane of the bees themselves I could easily live with OOF foreground flowers in preference, good attempt though</td>', 'Good action capture but it would have so much more impact if the focus was at the plane of the bees themselves I could easily live with OOF foreground flowers in preference, good attempt though', '2011-12-02 08:10:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6608576, 983413, 25024, '<td valign="top">A good attempt at a still life though for me I would prefer the focus point on the edge of the apple to define it more sharply from the background also the dark background corner of the plate is a little distracting</td>', 'A good attempt at a still life though for me I would prefer the focus point on the edge of the apple to define it more sharply from the background also the dark background corner of the plate is a little distracting', '2011-12-02 08:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608578, 985878, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great use of wide angle perspective and slow shutter speed to convey the waters movement, works really well in mono</td>', 'Nice composition and great use of wide angle perspective and slow shutter speed to convey the waters movement, works really well in mono', '2011-12-02 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608580, 985293, 25024, '<td valign="top">What a lovely and unusual portrait, I like it. I like the dark right slowly revealing detail and the light on the letter and lamp, I am less keen on the haze in particular the section that appears to be emanating from his chin, other than that a great image, good luck</td>', 'What a lovely and unusual portrait, I like it. I like the dark right slowly revealing detail and the light on the letter and lamp, I am less keen on the haze in particular the section that appears to be emanating from his chin, other than that a great image, good luck', '2011-12-02 08:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608582, 986306, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait though she a rather doleful expression but its naturalness has appeal. I like the bright pink bow of her hat but I find the background rather distracting, it would probably help if it were a little more OOF.</td>', 'Nice portrait though she a rather doleful expression but its naturalness has appeal. I like the bright pink bow of her hat but I find the background rather distracting, it would probably help if it were a little more OOF.', '2011-12-02 08:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608584, 986271, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great image, well observed and taken, though for me I have to say I''m not too keen on the vignette, good luck</td>', 'Great image, well observed and taken, though for me I have to say I''m not too keen on the vignette, good luck', '2011-12-02 08:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608585, 985941, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great image, well captured very alert looking, a fine portrait. Its a shame though that the background with its noise and compression artifacts does it no favours</td>', 'Great image, well captured very alert looking, a fine portrait. Its a shame though that the background with its noise and compression artifacts does it no favours', '2011-12-02 08:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608586, 985756, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good observation, timing and capture his inquisitiveness has been very well caught, works well in mono too.</td>', 'Good observation, timing and capture his inquisitiveness has been very well caught, works well in mono too.', '2011-12-02 08:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608588, 983287, 25024, '<td valign="top">The ''golden hour'' nicely captured with the waters reflections</td>', 'The ''golden hour'' nicely captured with the waters reflections', '2011-12-02 08:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608604, 985867, 25787, '<td valign="top">Poor Guy. Interesting reflection in his eye. Looks like he was indoors?</td>', 'Poor Guy. Interesting reflection in his eye. Looks like he was indoors?', '2011-12-02 08:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608605, 986183, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh those faces!!!!!  So wonderful.  Thanks for the morning grin this brought me.</td>', 'Oh those faces!!!!!  So wonderful.  Thanks for the morning grin this brought me.', '2011-12-02 08:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608608, 986186, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would make a great holiday card.  I love the sense of fancy.</td>', 'This would make a great holiday card.  I love the sense of fancy.', '2011-12-02 08:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608609, 986435, 15711, '<td valign="top">dARLING!!</td>', 'dARLING!!', '2011-12-02 09:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608653, 984292, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great timing to capture a great moment it really looks as though the dog is contributing to the text she''s sending, nice backlighting too.</td>', 'Great timing to capture a great moment it really looks as though the dog is contributing to the text she''s sending, nice backlighting too.', '2011-12-02 10:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608656, 986410, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice high key portrait, good lighting,personally I would love to see this in mono</td>', 'Nice high key portrait, good lighting,personally I would love to see this in mono', '2011-12-02 10:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608658, 985959, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint, perfect symmetry, a very interesting place it all  makes for an interesting image</td>', 'Great viewpoint, perfect symmetry, a very interesting place it all  makes for an interesting image', '2011-12-02 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
