(6609107, 985951, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very bold use of the sun and flare, I like the models pose and shallow DOF and the rim lighting, however, that flare spot over her left bosom is too strong a focal point it keeps taking my eye away from her lovely expressive face, personally I would clone it out.</td>', 'Very bold use of the sun and flare, I like the models pose and shallow DOF and the rim lighting, however, that flare spot over her left bosom is too strong a focal point it keeps taking my eye away from her lovely expressive face, personally I would clone it out.', '2011-12-02 17:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609108, 985033, 25024, '<td valign="top">Yes, she has lovely blue eyes, the lighting is generally good though I think the patch over her left temple is a little dark, I also think if she had pulled down on her vest it would make for a more pleasing result.</td>', 'Yes, she has lovely blue eyes, the lighting is generally good though I think the patch over her left temple is a little dark, I also think if she had pulled down on her vest it would make for a more pleasing result.', '2011-12-02 17:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609111, 986246, 25024, '<td valign="top">A magnificent beast against a magnificent backdrop, it would have been even better if you could have gone in a little closer and got some eye contact but still a very pleasing image</td>', 'A magnificent beast against a magnificent backdrop, it would have been even better if you could have gone in a little closer and got some eye contact but still a very pleasing image', '2011-12-02 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
