(6609139, 982293, 25024, '<td valign="top">Well I have to ask why? Great underwater shot it has a lot of energy going on, the only thing is the diver in the background that once you''ve spotted them it just keeps drawing you back - clone perhaps?</td>', 'Well I have to ask why? Great underwater shot it has a lot of energy going on, the only thing is the diver in the background that once you''ve spotted them it just keeps drawing you back - clone perhaps?', '2011-12-02 18:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
