(6609143, 986215, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle view with plenty of foreground interest, nice timing in capturing the not too bright sun and what an impressive cloud bank, should do well</td>', 'Nice wide angle view with plenty of foreground interest, nice timing in capturing the not too bright sun and what an impressive cloud bank, should do well', '2011-12-02 18:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609145, 986273, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like the winding lane leading you into the image, sorry but the sky just feels a little unnatural somehow in a way i can''t quit put my finger on, I think its probably what appears to be evidence of masking through the trees, the sky behind the trees on the right looks much brighter than the left. I may be wrong and doing you an injustice but good luck anyway</td>', 'I like the winding lane leading you into the image, sorry but the sky just feels a little unnatural somehow in a way i can''t quit put my finger on, I think its probably what appears to be evidence of masking through the trees, the sky behind the trees on the right looks much brighter than the left. I may be wrong and doing you an injustice but good luck anyway', '2011-12-02 18:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609146, 986427, 25024, '<td valign="top">A family moment for the album. I find the tilt rather distracting it isn''t enough to be deliberately exaggerated and leaves it looking as though its in need of straightening, anyway, the moment itself is nicely captured</td>', 'A family moment for the album. I find the tilt rather distracting it isn''t enough to be deliberately exaggerated and leaves it looking as though its in need of straightening, anyway, the moment itself is nicely captured', '2011-12-02 18:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609148, 986234, 25024, '<td valign="top">You set yourself a very difficult job with this exposure! You''ve probably balanced it as well as you could but the strong shaft of sun(?)light has nearly obliterated detail which for me is not helping the image but anyway good luck with it</td>', 'You set yourself a very difficult job with this exposure! You''ve probably balanced it as well as you could but the strong shaft of sun(?)light has nearly obliterated detail which for me is not helping the image but anyway good luck with it', '2011-12-02 18:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609152, 982904, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like to see an unusual pose and this is one, a good portrait that works well in mono, I like the background bokeh</td>', 'I like to see an unusual pose and this is one, a good portrait that works well in mono, I like the background bokeh', '2011-12-02 18:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609155, 986148, 25024, '<td valign="top">That is one colourful dude! You can''t beat an eccentric individual can you, well spotted though I reckon he''d be hard to miss! I find the page on the ground intriguing, it leaves you asking has he rejected her or has he selected her and she''s fallen to the ground? Either way it definitely adds to the image. Good image, hope you do well</td>', 'That is one colourful dude! You can''t beat an eccentric individual can you, well spotted though I reckon he''d be hard to miss! I find the page on the ground intriguing, it leaves you asking has he rejected her or has he selected her and she''s fallen to the ground? Either way it definitely adds to the image. Good image, hope you do well', '2011-12-02 18:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609156, 985211, 25024, '<td valign="top">This had me wondering for a while whether it was actually coloured like this or added in PS, I suspect the latter owing to the masking residue left in the top left corner? Anyway, the concept is good and deserves to do well for that at least, well done</td>', 'This had me wondering for a while whether it was actually coloured like this or added in PS, I suspect the latter owing to the masking residue left in the top left corner? Anyway, the concept is good and deserves to do well for that at least, well done', '2011-12-02 18:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
