(6609159, 986405, 25024, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait of a lovely girl though I find her full on stare a little off-putting but nevertheless an accomplished portrait, well done</td>', 'A lovely portrait of a lovely girl though I find her full on stare a little off-putting but nevertheless an accomplished portrait, well done', '2011-12-02 18:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
