(6609971, 985012, 83313, '<td valign="top">If not for the excessive JPEG compression that was used, this would have been a wonderful shot. All the loss of clarity, blockiness and artifacting is due to saving with high levels of compression.  Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can get away with and still come in under the challenge limit. Your image editor should have a setting somewhere to adjust the compression level when saving.</td>', 'If not for the excessive JPEG compression that was used, this would have been a wonderful shot. All the loss of clarity, blockiness and artifacting is due to saving with high levels of compression.  Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can get away with and still come in under the challenge limit. Your image editor should have a setting somewhere to adjust the compression level when saving.', '2011-12-04 01:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609976, 985923, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find this to be quite interesting, but it took looking at it a bit to figure out why. It is almost as if the cowboy on the mural is trying to ride off into the sunset outside his limited scene.</td>', 'I find this to be quite interesting, but it took looking at it a bit to figure out why. It is almost as if the cowboy on the mural is trying to ride off into the sunset outside his limited scene.', '2011-12-04 01:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
