(6610015, 985921, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint and DOF the similar colours of the foreground make it feel as though the dog is emerging from it, good lighting and exposure a very impressive animal portrait, well done</td>', 'Great viewpoint and DOF the similar colours of the foreground make it feel as though the dog is emerging from it, good lighting and exposure a very impressive animal portrait, well done', '2011-12-04 06:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610018, 985344, 25024, '<td valign="top">Quite a good composition but I think I would prefer to see less of the building on the left, I like the softness throughout but because of this the plant feels artificial more like a paper plant, I think I would have preferred a more natural processing here. Anyway, good luck with it</td>', 'Quite a good composition but I think I would prefer to see less of the building on the left, I like the softness throughout but because of this the plant feels artificial more like a paper plant, I think I would have preferred a more natural processing here. Anyway, good luck with it', '2011-12-04 06:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610021, 985329, 25024, '<td valign="top">Oh yes! This was my exclamation on seeing it on my screen. I''m a sucker for motion blur anyway and this really appeals to me, I love the curve of the motion and subtle detail, The grainy feel adds to it together with the erotic impression of the female nude in an abstract form of presentation its all so appealing, has to be a fave, I wish you good luck with it</td>', 'Oh yes! This was my exclamation on seeing it on my screen. I''m a sucker for motion blur anyway and this really appeals to me, I love the curve of the motion and subtle detail, The grainy feel adds to it together with the erotic impression of the female nude in an abstract form of presentation its all so appealing, has to be a fave, I wish you good luck with it', '2011-12-04 06:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610023, 986274, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great image, I like the repetition of shapes between the hut and the distant mountain but i think I would there''s plenty of scope for a stop or more exposure to bring out the whites more, I do like the composition you''ve done a good job  of it</td>', 'Great image, I like the repetition of shapes between the hut and the distant mountain but i think I would there''s plenty of scope for a stop or more exposure to bring out the whites more, I do like the composition you''ve done a good job  of it', '2011-12-04 06:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610025, 986059, 25024, '<td valign="top">A good attempt to create something magical</td>', 'A good attempt to create something magical', '2011-12-04 06:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610026, 986253, 25024, '<td valign="top">The revealing garment is very sensuous but her expression is rather stern and somewhat off-putting or it has another reading which is ''take me if you dare''! So, although it conveys mixed messages its appealing because it does arouse a reaction, I have to say however that background wallpaper is off-putting but again some might argue that it adds to the femininity, anyway good luck</td>', 'The revealing garment is very sensuous but her expression is rather stern and somewhat off-putting or it has another reading which is ''take me if you dare''! So, although it conveys mixed messages its appealing because it does arouse a reaction, I have to say however that background wallpaper is off-putting but again some might argue that it adds to the femininity, anyway good luck', '2011-12-04 06:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610028, 986388, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette, very graphic, standing as it is on that structure it could almost double as a pub sign! It feels as though the sky has been saturated but I like the gradation, I also think I would prefer a landscape format to give more room to the bird to look into the space, anyway good luck</td>', 'Great silhouette, very graphic, standing as it is on that structure it could almost double as a pub sign! It feels as though the sky has been saturated but I like the gradation, I also think I would prefer a landscape format to give more room to the bird to look into the space, anyway good luck', '2011-12-04 06:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610033, 983691, 25024, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape though in view of your title I would have preferred it a bit earlier to see more evidence of the frost in the foreground. Thats always my problem too the bed pulls too hard!</td>', 'Interesting landscape though in view of your title I would have preferred it a bit earlier to see more evidence of the frost in the foreground. Thats always my problem too the bed pulls too hard!', '2011-12-04 06:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610035, 985263, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great macro good sharp focus and DOF where it matters, very vivid colours against the subdued tone of the leaf suggest this has been achieved in processing(?) Anyway, good luck with it</td>', 'Great macro good sharp focus and DOF where it matters, very vivid colours against the subdued tone of the leaf suggest this has been achieved in processing(?) Anyway, good luck with it', '2011-12-04 06:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610036, 986320, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice autumnal reflections, good light, good composition with the bridge adding to the overall appeal</td>', 'Nice autumnal reflections, good light, good composition with the bridge adding to the overall appeal', '2011-12-04 06:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610038, 986019, 25024, '<td valign="top">An interesting image with a pair of interesting characters each in the own world and given the title I interpret as the main character - ''doing it'' and the other one contemplating - ''doing it'' so for me at least the message comes over well. Good observation and capture, delivers the message stronger in mono too, well done</td>', 'An interesting image with a pair of interesting characters each in the own world and given the title I interpret as the main character - ''doing it'' and the other one contemplating - ''doing it'' so for me at least the message comes over well. Good observation and capture, delivers the message stronger in mono too, well done', '2011-12-04 06:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610039, 986069, 108580, '<td valign="top">Superlative composition. I have no idea how fluorescent the Northern Lights really are, but feel that you have boosted saturation here. Still it''s a technically difficult image to shoot from travelling, temperature, time of shoot to PP. 9.</td>', 'Superlative composition. I have no idea how fluorescent the Northern Lights really are, but feel that you have boosted saturation here. Still it''s a technically difficult image to shoot from travelling, temperature, time of shoot to PP. 9.', '2011-12-04 06:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610040, 982585, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good performance shot, I like her stance against the coloured lighting and the smoke I particularly like the silhouetted parts on red of her against the contrasting blue lit arm and leg, in fact I think there''s potential create another image with a tight crop of her alone especially in contrast to the keyboard players lack of apparent enthusiasm. Anyway, good capture, good luck with it</td>', 'Good performance shot, I like her stance against the coloured lighting and the smoke I particularly like the silhouetted parts on red of her against the contrasting blue lit arm and leg, in fact I think there''s potential create another image with a tight crop of her alone especially in contrast to the keyboard players lack of apparent enthusiasm. Anyway, good capture, good luck with it', '2011-12-04 06:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610041, 986216, 25024, '<td valign="top">nice rays through the trees though I think you could up the contrast for an even stronger effect</td>', 'nice rays through the trees though I think you could up the contrast for an even stronger effect', '2011-12-04 06:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610042, 983415, 108580, '<td valign="top">Spot on processing, sharpness, colour gradations and Zen like composition. Minimalist ''scapes are my favourite form of the genre. HM.</td>', 'Spot on processing, sharpness, colour gradations and Zen like composition. Minimalist ''scapes are my favourite form of the genre. HM.', '2011-12-04 06:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610044, 986363, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like the dynamics of the sky and the motion blur of the water</td>', 'I like the dynamics of the sky and the motion blur of the water', '2011-12-04 06:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610056, 982999, 25024, '<td valign="top">Attractively finished as these hoods are I much prefer to see the bird without but as a record shot of this part of falconry its good, i like the shallow DOF and the background colours</td>', 'Attractively finished as these hoods are I much prefer to see the bird without but as a record shot of this part of falconry its good, i like the shallow DOF and the background colours', '2011-12-04 07:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610066, 985706, 25024, '<td valign="top">A nice enough image that would probably have done well in the trees challenge. I hate to be too critical but I think the masking has left the trees and foreground looking rather unnatural against the rest of the image, anyway hope you do well with it</td>', 'A nice enough image that would probably have done well in the trees challenge. I hate to be too critical but I think the masking has left the trees and foreground looking rather unnatural against the rest of the image, anyway hope you do well with it', '2011-12-04 07:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610070, 986151, 25024, '<td valign="top">a lovely portrait with good sharp focus on the eyes and shallow DOF has given the image good impact, her lovely smile completes the image, very well captured</td>', 'a lovely portrait with good sharp focus on the eyes and shallow DOF has given the image good impact, her lovely smile completes the image, very well captured', '2011-12-04 07:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610078, 986243, 25024, '<td valign="top">he''s pretty well hidden isn''t he, I like the texture of the main foreground tree but I think it would benefit from a bit of straightening, especially as the trees appear to be leaning to the right as well.</td>', 'he''s pretty well hidden isn''t he, I like the texture of the main foreground tree but I think it would benefit from a bit of straightening, especially as the trees appear to be leaning to the right as well.', '2011-12-04 07:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610079, 986289, 25024, '<td valign="top">This is so much better than most of the sunrise/sunset shots on here, its simplicity is its strength but the receding soft focus adds a great deal to the overall appeal of the shot, hope you do well with this</td>', 'This is so much better than most of the sunrise/sunset shots on here, its simplicity is its strength but the receding soft focus adds a great deal to the overall appeal of the shot, hope you do well with this', '2011-12-04 07:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610081, 986101, 25024, '<td valign="top">The overexposed background helps the toy stand out more but the little remaining detail there grabs my attention more than it would do if it were a truly plain background, an you''ve lost some detail in the white fur too, anyway, good luck with it</td>', 'The overexposed background helps the toy stand out more but the little remaining detail there grabs my attention more than it would do if it were a truly plain background, an you''ve lost some detail in the white fur too, anyway, good luck with it', '2011-12-04 07:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610085, 985814, 25024, '<td valign="top">an interesting social documentary study that reflects the difficulties of earning enough to live off, she looks as though she''s fed up with the wait to sell her last bunch, good lighting and nice soft shadow on the wall</td>', 'an interesting social documentary study that reflects the difficulties of earning enough to live off, she looks as though she''s fed up with the wait to sell her last bunch, good lighting and nice soft shadow on the wall', '2011-12-04 07:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610087, 985455, 25024, '<td valign="top">nice dynamic of the sunlit wave, I also like the varying shades of the buildings themselves, the bird adds another element of interest, but you need to clone out the sensor dust</td>', 'nice dynamic of the sunlit wave, I also like the varying shades of the buildings themselves, the bird adds another element of interest, but you need to clone out the sensor dust', '2011-12-04 07:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610091, 985926, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice one I like your creative approach here the OOFness works well as do the hues you have chosen, this wpuld also have been good in the trees challenge, I hope you do well with this</td>', 'Nice one I like your creative approach here the OOFness works well as do the hues you have chosen, this wpuld also have been good in the trees challenge, I hope you do well with this', '2011-12-04 07:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610092, 986294, 25024, '<td valign="top">well seen, I particularly like the rim frost, the detail is good but a larger DOF or holding the ca,era more parallel to the leave would have given you sharper detail throughout the leaf</td>', 'well seen, I particularly like the rim frost, the detail is good but a larger DOF or holding the ca,era more parallel to the leave would have given you sharper detail throughout the leaf', '2011-12-04 07:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610096, 986281, 25024, '<td valign="top">Symmetry is all important in a shot like this and you''ve not done too bad a job of it, I can imagine the difficulties you had in getting this set up, the detail is good, all in all you''ve done credit to what is a magnificent work of art, well done</td>', 'Symmetry is all important in a shot like this and you''ve not done too bad a job of it, I can imagine the difficulties you had in getting this set up, the detail is good, all in all you''ve done credit to what is a magnificent work of art, well done', '2011-12-04 07:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610097, 985664, 25024, '<td valign="top">the long exposure adds another dimension to the image, though given your title I think I would have preferred to see a little more detail in the person</td>', 'the long exposure adds another dimension to the image, though given your title I think I would have preferred to see a little more detail in the person', '2011-12-04 07:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610098, 985919, 25024, '<td valign="top">A good advertising shot with good lighting and detail though perhaps a touch more DOF would heave rendered the front two sweets sharper as well.</td>', 'A good advertising shot with good lighting and detail though perhaps a touch more DOF would heave rendered the front two sweets sharper as well.', '2011-12-04 08:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610099, 985152, 25024, '<td valign="top">well done for attempting to create something that bit different though its appeal, for me at least, is somewhat diminished</td>', 'well done for attempting to create something that bit different though its appeal, for me at least, is somewhat diminished', '2011-12-04 08:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610100, 986267, 25024, '<td valign="top">I can see where you''re coming from with the title with the boats replication of the seas hues, i like theinclusion of the boat and person at the waters edge</td>', 'I can see where you''re coming from with the title with the boats replication of the seas hues, i like theinclusion of the boat and person at the waters edge', '2011-12-04 08:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610101, 986319, 25024, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the skies appearance is due to a long exposure? A much longer exposure would have emphasised the clouds movement and given it a dynamic but for me its smudgy appearance is not really to my liking, good luck anyway</td>', 'I''m assuming the skies appearance is due to a long exposure? A much longer exposure would have emphasised the clouds movement and given it a dynamic but for me its smudgy appearance is not really to my liking, good luck anyway', '2011-12-04 08:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610102, 983691, 108580, '<td valign="top">I studied this image for a few seconds and discovered the arch bridge in the background. Beautiful simple image technically shot. Hope to see where it was shot on roll-over.</td>', 'I studied this image for a few seconds and discovered the arch bridge in the background. Beautiful simple image technically shot. Hope to see where it was shot on roll-over.', '2011-12-04 08:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610103, 985294, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great performer shot, it works really well in mono their is a great range of tones across the zone,great pose and I like the motion blur in the finger of the fan, the only thing that lets it down is the person in the foreground who appears to be more interested in reading something in front of him and the unimpressed feel of the three on the right. Anyway, a good shot, hope you do well with it</td>', 'Great performer shot, it works really well in mono their is a great range of tones across the zone,great pose and I like the motion blur in the finger of the fan, the only thing that lets it down is the person in the foreground who appears to be more interested in reading something in front of him and the unimpressed feel of the three on the right. Anyway, a good shot, hope you do well with it', '2011-12-04 08:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610104, 986401, 25024, '<td valign="top">a nice record shot but sorry the processing, for me, is way too much</td>', 'a nice record shot but sorry the processing, for me, is way too much', '2011-12-04 08:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610107, 985975, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the reflections, particularly the wiggly ones to the right, all in all a good shot, good luck</td>', 'Great shot, I love the reflections, particularly the wiggly ones to the right, all in all a good shot, good luck', '2011-12-04 08:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610108, 985294, 108580, '<td valign="top">Take away the white rectangle and this would be a fabulous gig shot. Yes you couldn''t control that at the time, but during PP and submit it elsewhere online. I love the way the singer separates the white right from the black left.</td>', 'Take away the white rectangle and this would be a fabulous gig shot. Yes you couldn''t control that at the time, but during PP and submit it elsewhere online. I love the way the singer separates the white right from the black left.', '2011-12-04 08:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610109, 986084, 25024, '<td valign="top">what amazing camouflage this must be amongst the corals, great record shot though the lighter part of the background gives away the probability that this is an aquarium shot(?), anyway, a good shot that I hope does you proud</td>', 'what amazing camouflage this must be amongst the corals, great record shot though the lighter part of the background gives away the probability that this is an aquarium shot(?), anyway, a good shot that I hope does you proud', '2011-12-04 08:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610110, 985714, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wow Cuba! Don''t think I have ever seen a shot on DPC from here. So typical 50''s. And the B&amp;W helps that mood along. Nice!</td>', 'Wow Cuba! Don''t think I have ever seen a shot on DPC from here. So typical 50''s. And the B&W helps that mood along. Nice!', '2011-12-04 08:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610111, 985057, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great mono shot, I like the motion blur of the water, good composition and perspective, good luck with it</td>', 'Great mono shot, I like the motion blur of the water, good composition and perspective, good luck with it', '2011-12-04 08:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610113, 985826, 108580, '<td valign="top">"Amateurs argue about bodies. Pro''s argue about glass. Photographers let the images argue for themselves" quote by HarveyG :)<br/> <br/>Again another minimalist landscape so up my alley. Sure there''s a lot going on cloud-wise but the thin strip of land along the horison creates a beautiful simple separation.</td>', '"Amateurs argue about bodies. Pro''s argue about glass. Photographers let the images argue for themselves" quote by HarveyG :) Again another minimalist landscape so up my alley. Sure there''s a lot going on cloud-wise but the thin strip of land along the horison creates a beautiful simple separation.', '2011-12-04 08:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610117, 986183, 25024, '<td valign="top">lovely shot, love the darkness with the horse on the left emerging from it, great image should do well</td>', 'lovely shot, love the darkness with the horse on the left emerging from it, great image should do well', '2011-12-04 08:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610119, 985023, 25024, '<td valign="top">nice wide angle effect works really well in this image, very bright colours it would make a good advertising shot, have you approached them? Anyway, well done</td>', 'nice wide angle effect works really well in this image, very bright colours it would make a good advertising shot, have you approached them? Anyway, well done', '2011-12-04 08:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610120, 986370, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great mono abstract, very reminiscent of a shot I did of some venetian blinds this is obviously on a much grander scale and all the better for it, hope you do well with it</td>', 'Great mono abstract, very reminiscent of a shot I did of some venetian blinds this is obviously on a much grander scale and all the better for it, hope you do well with it', '2011-12-04 08:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610121, 985242, 25024, '<td valign="top">great viewpoint, good symmetry, pleasing range of tones works really well in mono</td>', 'great viewpoint, good symmetry, pleasing range of tones works really well in mono', '2011-12-04 08:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610123, 986298, 25024, '<td valign="top">lovely bark detail, what amazing colours though they do feel a little over saturated, I think moving it over to the right would have improved the composition but anyway still a good image, good luck</td>', 'lovely bark detail, what amazing colours though they do feel a little over saturated, I think moving it over to the right would have improved the composition but anyway still a good image, good luck', '2011-12-04 08:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610125, 985734, 11854, '<td valign="top">Purgatory. <br/> <br/>Love this!</td>', 'Purgatory.  Love this!', '2011-12-04 08:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610127, 986150, 11854, '<td valign="top">OMG what a pose! Love this!</td>', 'OMG what a pose! Love this!', '2011-12-04 08:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610128, 986089, 25024, '<td valign="top">vast open spaces scarred by an old rusty fence whose foreground post adds interest, well done</td>', 'vast open spaces scarred by an old rusty fence whose foreground post adds interest, well done', '2011-12-04 08:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610129, 986184, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!</td>', 'This is awesome!', '2011-12-04 08:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610130, 986076, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Stunning!</td>', 'Beautiful! Stunning!', '2011-12-04 08:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610131, 986252, 11854, '<td valign="top">OMG! How precious is that!</td>', 'OMG! How precious is that!', '2011-12-04 08:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610132, 985059, 25024, '<td valign="top">an interesting image of what is obviously a magnificent building it records well the opulence of our forebears for whom aesthetics were all important, I like the way the WA lens has exaggerated the curve of the window, a good exposure that has recorded detail well. Great capture, very creatively done, i wish you well with it</td>', 'an interesting image of what is obviously a magnificent building it records well the opulence of our forebears for whom aesthetics were all important, I like the way the WA lens has exaggerated the curve of the window, a good exposure that has recorded detail well. Great capture, very creatively done, i wish you well with it', '2011-12-04 08:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610133, 986436, 25024, '<td valign="top">a good wide angle landscape, nice mirroring of the reflections, I like the two birds in flight too, good luck</td>', 'a good wide angle landscape, nice mirroring of the reflections, I like the two birds in flight too, good luck', '2011-12-04 08:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610135, 985621, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good long exposure has created a sort of mystery element to it, I like the reflections in the sand, a good image, good luck</td>', 'Good long exposure has created a sort of mystery element to it, I like the reflections in the sand, a good image, good luck', '2011-12-04 08:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610136, 985638, 25024, '<td valign="top">an interesting image that in addition to the humorous element also leaves you questioning just how temporary this aspect of their life is so because of that it has a powerful element to it, well seen and captured</td>', 'an interesting image that in addition to the humorous element also leaves you questioning just how temporary this aspect of their life is so because of that it has a powerful element to it, well seen and captured', '2011-12-04 08:53:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6610137, 981938, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good composition and capture, nice whites of the snow, well done</td>', 'Good composition and capture, nice whites of the snow, well done', '2011-12-04 08:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610139, 986211, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I like the fact that you''ve not been tempted to go in much closer, the bird''s small size and position gives a real feel to the birds environment, great lighting and nicely OOF with just the right amount of detail coming through though it feels as though its been added in PS(?). Anyway its a nice image well done</td>', 'Great composition, I like the fact that you''ve not been tempted to go in much closer, the bird''s small size and position gives a real feel to the birds environment, great lighting and nicely OOF with just the right amount of detail coming through though it feels as though its been added in PS(?). Anyway its a nice image well done', '2011-12-04 09:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610142, 986418, 25024, '<td valign="top">nice lighting makes for a nice landscape, looks great in mono though it feels as though it could do with some straightening, as for the ''dowsing rod'' shadows personally I think I would have preferred a more panoramic crop excluding them though you could argue they help to lead the eye into the image, anyway, good luck</td>', 'nice lighting makes for a nice landscape, looks great in mono though it feels as though it could do with some straightening, as for the ''dowsing rod'' shadows personally I think I would have preferred a more panoramic crop excluding them though you could argue they help to lead the eye into the image, anyway, good luck', '2011-12-04 09:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610146, 985847, 25024, '<td valign="top">nice simple image with nice reflections though I would prefer the ''lovers'' position to be lower in the frame left. Its taken me all this while to notice the ghost images, sorry, but this leaves me very confused about the image as a whole, anyway, good luck with it</td>', 'nice simple image with nice reflections though I would prefer the ''lovers'' position to be lower in the frame left. Its taken me all this while to notice the ghost images, sorry, but this leaves me very confused about the image as a whole, anyway, good luck with it', '2011-12-04 09:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610147, 986272, 25024, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, looks good in mono though I would prefer a shallower DOF to reduce the distracting detail to the right</td>', 'interesting composition, looks good in mono though I would prefer a shallower DOF to reduce the distracting detail to the right', '2011-12-04 09:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610148, 986423, 25024, '<td valign="top">lovely unusual pose, I love the soft focus of the rest of her body, very erotic, a couple of minor points I think would have helped would be to try and soften the hair down and though its not too noticeable her frown lines are somewhat visible perhaps just soften those down too a touch. Its still a beautiful image of a beautiful girl I hope you do well with it</td>', 'lovely unusual pose, I love the soft focus of the rest of her body, very erotic, a couple of minor points I think would have helped would be to try and soften the hair down and though its not too noticeable her frown lines are somewhat visible perhaps just soften those down too a touch. Its still a beautiful image of a beautiful girl I hope you do well with it', '2011-12-04 09:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610149, 986166, 25024, '<td valign="top">What a lovely pleasing image, a girl and her pony. I love the stance and confident smile of the girl and the eye of the pony looking at her. Great focus and DOF and great mono processing, all in all a great image, I wish you well with it</td>', 'What a lovely pleasing image, a girl and her pony. I love the stance and confident smile of the girl and the eye of the pony looking at her. Great focus and DOF and great mono processing, all in all a great image, I wish you well with it', '2011-12-04 09:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610150, 985572, 25024, '<td valign="top">What a lovely portrait, I love the reflection and its desat look, excellent composition and processing, should do well.</td>', 'What a lovely portrait, I love the reflection and its desat look, excellent composition and processing, should do well.', '2011-12-04 09:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610151, 983620, 25024, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous macro, perfect lighting, excellent use of DOF against the dark background the image has impact this should do well</td>', 'Gorgeous macro, perfect lighting, excellent use of DOF against the dark background the image has impact this should do well', '2011-12-04 09:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610152, 982765, 25024, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a striking image, very simple and very effective, should do very well</td>', 'Wow, what a striking image, very simple and very effective, should do very well', '2011-12-04 09:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610153, 985623, 25024, '<td valign="top">In yer face macro! What amazing magnification and DOF, the reflection adds to an already stunning image, well done</td>', 'In yer face macro! What amazing magnification and DOF, the reflection adds to an already stunning image, well done', '2011-12-04 09:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610154, 985858, 25024, '<td valign="top">Terrific macro, great DOF, i just love the way the water is bending to him, deserves to do well</td>', 'Terrific macro, great DOF, i just love the way the water is bending to him, deserves to do well', '2011-12-04 09:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610155, 985734, 25024, '<td valign="top">Its nice to see bold experimentation, I think the over exposure here has worked well, I like the way the escalator disappear into the ether and in the foreground the way detail only begins to emerge towards the edges but you have kept detail in the all important people. A great experiment that I hope does well for you</td>', 'Its nice to see bold experimentation, I think the over exposure here has worked well, I like the way the escalator disappear into the ether and in the foreground the way detail only begins to emerge towards the edges but you have kept detail in the all important people. A great experiment that I hope does well for you', '2011-12-04 09:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610156, 986292, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, lovely sharpness where its needed, great feather detail and lovely softness throughout the rest. I assume these are not saturated colours anyway, a very striking image that should do well for you</td>', 'Great portrait, lovely sharpness where its needed, great feather detail and lovely softness throughout the rest. I assume these are not saturated colours anyway, a very striking image that should do well for you', '2011-12-04 09:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610157, 985649, 25024, '<td valign="top">The way the long exposure has emphasised the clouds motion has created a real dynamic to the image, great result it should be well up there</td>', 'The way the long exposure has emphasised the clouds motion has created a real dynamic to the image, great result it should be well up there', '2011-12-04 09:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610158, 984818, 25024, '<td valign="top">very well capture a superb macro, it may have been done many times but still good when its done well like this</td>', 'very well capture a superb macro, it may have been done many times but still good when its done well like this', '2011-12-04 09:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610159, 985354, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice dynamics of the dunes and cirrus(?) clouds, good inclusion of the person adds scale</td>', 'Nice dynamics of the dunes and cirrus(?) clouds, good inclusion of the person adds scale', '2011-12-04 09:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610160, 986426, 25024, '<td valign="top">An excellent mono image, great processing, unless you took it with a tilt and shift I assume you have straightened the verticals, anyway, you''ve done a nice job. Nice composition and viewpoint including the busy streets but most of all I like the way the cloud adds emphasis to the height of the tall building. Nice one.</td>', 'An excellent mono image, great processing, unless you took it with a tilt and shift I assume you have straightened the verticals, anyway, you''ve done a nice job. Nice composition and viewpoint including the busy streets but most of all I like the way the cloud adds emphasis to the height of the tall building. Nice one.', '2011-12-04 09:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610161, 985618, 25024, '<td valign="top">terrific viewpoint and composition, great processing too, it has immediate impact</td>', 'terrific viewpoint and composition, great processing too, it has immediate impact', '2011-12-04 09:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610162, 985557, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice pleasing portrait with added appeal from her position on the ground amongst all the autumnal leaves which add a lovely OOF and colourful foreground and background, very nicely done. I wonder if changing the purple of her garment to a more rustic colour would help?</td>', 'Nice pleasing portrait with added appeal from her position on the ground amongst all the autumnal leaves which add a lovely OOF and colourful foreground and background, very nicely done. I wonder if changing the purple of her garment to a more rustic colour would help?', '2011-12-04 09:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610164, 986314, 25024, '<td valign="top">What a demanding abstract! Thanks to your title I can assume its a boat? I like a demanding image that makes me search for its purpose and meaning but to be honest, I find that I am having to search too hard here there are a lot of confusing elements and my eye has no strong focal point to settle on. I wish you luck</td>', 'What a demanding abstract! Thanks to your title I can assume its a boat? I like a demanding image that makes me search for its purpose and meaning but to be honest, I find that I am having to search too hard here there are a lot of confusing elements and my eye has no strong focal point to settle on. I wish you luck', '2011-12-04 09:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610165, 985603, 25024, '<td valign="top">An accomplished image, great DOF, symmetry and processing</td>', 'An accomplished image, great DOF, symmetry and processing', '2011-12-04 09:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610166, 985923, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great, an image that leaves me with more questions than answers!</td>', 'Great, an image that leaves me with more questions than answers!', '2011-12-04 09:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610167, 986308, 25024, '<td valign="top">All credit to you for tackling a difficult subject particularly for western culture. Your timing has captured a very tender moment that I''m sure many people would argue should be left to the privacy of the immediate family, assuming they have given their permission for you to do this then it should be treated compassionately as you have done here</td>', 'All credit to you for tackling a difficult subject particularly for western culture. Your timing has captured a very tender moment that I''m sure many people would argue should be left to the privacy of the immediate family, assuming they have given their permission for you to do this then it should be treated compassionately as you have done here', '2011-12-04 09:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610168, 986358, 25024, '<td valign="top">Blimey, is that the time! <br/> <br/>A very striking (pun intended) image, I like the white face against the generally low key background though I have to say all those yellow lights leave me somewhat confused. A very original image, hope you do well with it</td>', 'Blimey, is that the time!  A very striking (pun intended) image, I like the white face against the generally low key background though I have to say all those yellow lights leave me somewhat confused. A very original image, hope you do well with it', '2011-12-04 09:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610169, 986283, 25024, '<td valign="top">GReat image, lovely colours, nice foreground and just the right amount of motion blur, the flare in the top right mars an otherwise excellent image, good luck</td>', 'GReat image, lovely colours, nice foreground and just the right amount of motion blur, the flare in the top right mars an otherwise excellent image, good luck', '2011-12-04 09:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610172, 986031, 25024, '<td valign="top">In conjunction with your title it would have been better if you could have photographed it in a light that enabled you to capture the crisp shining whites of the front as well, also it could do with more DOF to sharpen up the front elements. Well observed and good luck</td>', 'In conjunction with your title it would have been better if you could have photographed it in a light that enabled you to capture the crisp shining whites of the front as well, also it could do with more DOF to sharpen up the front elements. Well observed and good luck', '2011-12-04 09:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6610185, 985344, 118154, '<td valign="top">yes best so far ,love it.</td>', 'yes best so far ,love it.', '2011-12-04 10:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
