(6610626, 985730, 26151, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but I think the background might be a little too busy here. The bird''s face, which is usually the most important part of a picture of a human or animal, gets lost in the plants behind him.</td>', 'Nice colors, but I think the background might be a little too busy here. The bird''s face, which is usually the most important part of a picture of a human or animal, gets lost in the plants behind him.', '2011-12-04 21:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
