(6611432, 986216, 131284, '<td valign="top">A nice b&amp;w, well processed. If only there was some hook in the scene to take it over the edge. Still, this easily gets a 7 from me.</td>', 'A nice b&w, well processed. If only there was some hook in the scene to take it over the edge. Still, this easily gets a 7 from me.', '2011-12-05 18:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
