(6612305, 984292, 47470, '<td valign="top">Lovely moment you captured.  I would have preferred a tighter crop on top and maybe a bit tighter on the right too.</td>', 'Lovely moment you captured.  I would have preferred a tighter crop on top and maybe a bit tighter on the right too.', '2011-12-07 00:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612308, 986303, 47470, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet very beautiful.  I think I might prefer a touch more contrast in the upper tonal ranges.</td>', 'So simple, yet very beautiful.  I think I might prefer a touch more contrast in the upper tonal ranges.', '2011-12-07 00:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612315, 986053, 47470, '<td valign="top">Wow, it really does look like a dream with the milky water, bright blues, and palm trees!  I only wish the bush on the lower left was removed or if it was something more tropical-looking.</td>', 'Wow, it really does look like a dream with the milky water, bright blues, and palm trees!  I only wish the bush on the lower left was removed or if it was something more tropical-looking.', '2011-12-07 00:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612325, 985271, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think that having flowers inside the hood of an old car is unusual enough that people would have noticed it without the selective desaturation, so I don''t think selective desaturation helped this image convey its meaning.  I think that keeping the entire image in color would have make the visuals stronger.</td>', 'I think that having flowers inside the hood of an old car is unusual enough that people would have noticed it without the selective desaturation, so I don''t think selective desaturation helped this image convey its meaning.  I think that keeping the entire image in color would have make the visuals stronger.', '2011-12-07 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612333, 985926, 47470, '<td valign="top">That looks like some extreme chromatic aberration.  It does give a particular atmosphere to the image when paired with the blur, but I''m still not quite grasping the point or the meaning you''re trying to convey.  Sorry if that sounds harsh.</td>', 'That looks like some extreme chromatic aberration.  It does give a particular atmosphere to the image when paired with the blur, but I''m still not quite grasping the point or the meaning you''re trying to convey.  Sorry if that sounds harsh.', '2011-12-07 00:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612343, 985301, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred if the cup and saucer on the left were removed and if the set with the rose was centered.  Unique idea and great color.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred if the cup and saucer on the left were removed and if the set with the rose was centered.  Unique idea and great color.', '2011-12-07 00:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612350, 986401, 47470, '<td valign="top">The sky looks like a watercolor painting, which is a lovely touch.  I only wish those cars hadn''t been parked there because they break the timelessness of the rest of the image.</td>', 'The sky looks like a watercolor painting, which is a lovely touch.  I only wish those cars hadn''t been parked there because they break the timelessness of the rest of the image.', '2011-12-07 00:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612379, 985164, 47470, '<td valign="top">This feels cluttered to me.</td>', 'This feels cluttered to me.', '2011-12-07 00:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612385, 985706, 47470, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred if the camera was repositioned to include more of the ground in the frame and a bit less of the sky.  All of the texture, detail, and interest is in the land, so I would prefer to see more of that.</td>', 'I would have preferred if the camera was repositioned to include more of the ground in the frame and a bit less of the sky.  All of the texture, detail, and interest is in the land, so I would prefer to see more of that.', '2011-12-07 00:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612394, 986364, 47470, '<td valign="top">Too bad there weren''t some majestic clouds to match the majesty of the ship.</td>', 'Too bad there weren''t some majestic clouds to match the majesty of the ship.', '2011-12-07 00:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612402, 985293, 47470, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the atmosphere created by the light, depth of field, and color.  I''m not terribly sure what the story is (I''d love to know more!) or what the connection is between the boy, the letter, and the lantern.</td>', 'I absolutely love the atmosphere created by the light, depth of field, and color.  I''m not terribly sure what the story is (I''d love to know more!) or what the connection is between the boy, the letter, and the lantern.', '2011-12-07 00:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612406, 986174, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think some more refined sharpening and a bit more contrast would have strengthened this image.</td>', 'I think some more refined sharpening and a bit more contrast would have strengthened this image.', '2011-12-07 00:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612407, 985290, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the texture, especially the texture in the wall and how it contrasts with the texture of the water.</td>', 'I love the colors and the texture, especially the texture in the wall and how it contrasts with the texture of the water.', '2011-12-07 00:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612411, 985595, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the post-processing effect.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the post-processing effect.', '2011-12-07 00:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612413, 986435, 47470, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit off on my monitor.  I think I would have preferred a square crop with the left part removed, but keeping the painting in the frame.  Interesting subject.</td>', 'The colors seem a bit off on my monitor.  I think I would have preferred a square crop with the left part removed, but keeping the painting in the frame.  Interesting subject.', '2011-12-07 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612417, 986201, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love that the colors of the background mimic the colors in the flower.  nice attention to detail.</td>', 'I love that the colors of the background mimic the colors in the flower.  nice attention to detail.', '2011-12-07 00:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612418, 986409, 47470, '<td valign="top">Something about the colors, texture, light, and framing make this stand out among all the picture of old cars.  I love the atmosphere you''ve created.  Back to bump it up!</td>', 'Something about the colors, texture, light, and framing make this stand out among all the picture of old cars.  I love the atmosphere you''ve created.  Back to bump it up!', '2011-12-07 00:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612425, 986384, 47470, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a tighter crop on the right.</td>', 'I would have preferred a tighter crop on the right.', '2011-12-07 00:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612429, 986308, 47470, '<td valign="top">Now here''s a picture you don''t see every day.  I''m curious as to what made you take this picture.  I don''t mean that to sound accusatory; it''s just that it seems strange for someone to want to capture a child''s morbid curiosity as she kinda pokes at her deceased relative.  It''s interesting that you thought to take a picture of this.  I''m also very interested in seeing what everyone else''s reaction to this is : )</td>', 'Now here''s a picture you don''t see every day.  I''m curious as to what made you take this picture.  I don''t mean that to sound accusatory; it''s just that it seems strange for someone to want to capture a child''s morbid curiosity as she kinda pokes at her deceased relative.  It''s interesting that you thought to take a picture of this.  I''m also very interested in seeing what everyone else''s reaction to this is : )', '2011-12-07 00:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612440, 986174, 35467, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! My top shot in my portfolio is very similar but not as good as this one. All the best</td>', 'Wonderful! My top shot in my portfolio is very similar but not as good as this one. All the best', '2011-12-07 00:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612443, 986076, 47470, '<td valign="top">The lighting and processing on this is very well done.  Her expression is very intriguing too.  The wind in her hair is a nice touch that adds interest and atmosphere.  Great image.</td>', 'The lighting and processing on this is very well done.  Her expression is very intriguing too.  The wind in her hair is a nice touch that adds interest and atmosphere.  Great image.', '2011-12-07 00:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612445, 984385, 47470, '<td valign="top">The tones in this are wonderful.  I love the contrast between the soft steam clouds and the sharp industrialness of the structure.  The starbursts add a nice touch too.</td>', 'The tones in this are wonderful.  I love the contrast between the soft steam clouds and the sharp industrialness of the structure.  The starbursts add a nice touch too.', '2011-12-07 00:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612448, 986025, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think this captures the essence of winter perfectly.</td>', 'I think this captures the essence of winter perfectly.', '2011-12-07 00:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612453, 986425, 47470, '<td valign="top">The reflection makes it a bit difficult to understand what is going on in the image right away, but that''s why I like it.  I''m glad you left it in color to add to the frenetic feeling of the image, especially since it contrasts with the actions of the two main people.</td>', 'The reflection makes it a bit difficult to understand what is going on in the image right away, but that''s why I like it.  I''m glad you left it in color to add to the frenetic feeling of the image, especially since it contrasts with the actions of the two main people.', '2011-12-07 00:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612455, 986340, 47470, '<td valign="top">Something about this feels really nostalgic, sweet, and sad.  I keep bumping it up.  I really hope this is a real child and not a statue.</td>', 'Something about this feels really nostalgic, sweet, and sad.  I keep bumping it up.  I really hope this is a real child and not a statue.', '2011-12-07 00:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612456, 986184, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love how perfect and straight her form is with pointed toes and all.  Looks like she is having a wonderful time.</td>', 'I love how perfect and straight her form is with pointed toes and all.  Looks like she is having a wonderful time.', '2011-12-07 01:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6612460, 985714, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the way the far end of the alley fades into white.  It looks almost like an old film photograph.<br/> <br/>I keep coming back to bump this up, but now that it''s up to a 10, I can''t give it anything more than high praise.</td>', 'I love the way the far end of the alley fades into white.  It looks almost like an old film photograph. I keep coming back to bump this up, but now that it''s up to a 10, I can''t give it anything more than high praise.', '2011-12-07 01:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
