(6612531, 985792, 38509, '<td valign="top">This is in bad photo in my opinion ... strange composition, boring subject, IQ is very bad (i presume it is taken with mobile phone), the framing has some strange artifacts on the right side border and background looks like computer generated something but probably is generated by DOF and the purple fringing on the branch is too strong.<br/> <br/>So my decision is to give this photo score of one. :-) NHF</td>', 'This is in bad photo in my opinion ... strange composition, boring subject, IQ is very bad (i presume it is taken with mobile phone), the framing has some strange artifacts on the right side border and background looks like computer generated something but probably is generated by DOF and the purple fringing on the branch is too strong. So my decision is to give this photo score of one. :-) NHF', '2011-12-07 02:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
