(6613242, 983620, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry...just a bit too over processed for me.</td>', 'Sorry...just a bit too over processed for me.', '2011-12-07 19:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6613243, 986305, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like it overall, but it doesn''t feel balanced.  Too much empty grey sky there.  Options may have been to crop down so you had nearly equal thirds (brown grass, buildings, and sky) and then apply a letterbox border - or - crop down and also come in on the left to keep a similar aspect ratio to what you have now.<br/> <br/>Lovely tones in this.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like it overall, but it doesn''t feel balanced.  Too much empty grey sky there.  Options may have been to crop down so you had nearly equal thirds (brown grass, buildings, and sky) and then apply a letterbox border - or - crop down and also come in on the left to keep a similar aspect ratio to what you have now. Lovely tones in this.  Good luck.', '2011-12-07 19:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
