(6613269, 986288, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nice and without knowing the situation it''s hard to suggest...but WOW!  If you could have come in a bit more to pick up one or both horses with the fog, silhouetted trees, sky, etc...that would be awesome.  Sorry.  Hope that didn''t come across as mean.  You may have only had a 24-70 with you - or maybe you really, really like this composition.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'This is nice and without knowing the situation it''s hard to suggest...but WOW!  If you could have come in a bit more to pick up one or both horses with the fog, silhouetted trees, sky, etc...that would be awesome.  Sorry.  Hope that didn''t come across as mean.  You may have only had a 24-70 with you - or maybe you really, really like this composition.  :-)  Good luck.', '2011-12-07 19:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
