(6613842, 985760, 108580, '<td valign="top">Avg (commenters): 5.3333 x 3 commenter votes = 16<br/>I gave it an 8 (leaves you with 8 from 16)<br/>Sid couldn''t have given it a 10 (there were no 10''s), nor 9 or 8 based on the remainder of 8 after my vote with another commenter''s score still to factor in so it might have been a 7<br/>Mathematically <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=119012" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mike_311</a> must have given it a 1 based on his comment. Other combinations could be 2/6 3/5 4/4 but I don''t see sid giving a 4 or 5.<br/> <br/>It''s not just another wine glass shot Mike. This one has a unique twist and the lighting setup is par exelans.</td>', 'Avg (commenters): 5.3333 x 3 commenter votes = 16I gave it an 8 (leaves you with 8 from 16)Sid couldn''t have given it a 10 (there were no 10''s), nor 9 or 8 based on the remainder of 8 after my vote with another commenter''s score still to factor in so it might have been a 7Mathematically  mike_311 must have given it a 1 based on his comment. Other combinations could be 2/6 3/5 4/4 but I don''t see sid giving a 4 or 5. It''s not just another wine glass shot Mike. This one has a unique twist and the lighting setup is par exelans.', '2011-12-08 01:32:26.000000', NULL, 0),
