(6613888, 986165, 93565, '<td valign="top">Bummer this didn''t top 6.<br/>Gave me the same feel as this shot <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=576828" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/731/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_576828.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/731/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_576828.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/731/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_576828.jpg"/></a>, but not as intense.<br/>I think pictures like this of cows and bulls can be pretty cool, I like this. I''ll echo what I said on Simms photo here, as well:<br/> <br/>"I hadn''t seen this one before... and I was missing out. This is like the cow-porn equivalent of the rugged cowboy shot. Gritty. Excellently done."</td>', 'Bummer this didn''t top 6.Gave me the same feel as this shot , but not as intense.I think pictures like this of cows and bulls can be pretty cool, I like this. I''ll echo what I said on Simms photo here, as well: "I hadn''t seen this one before... and I was missing out. This is like the cow-porn equivalent of the rugged cowboy shot. Gritty. Excellently done."', '2011-12-08 03:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
