(6613921, 984610, 93565, '<td valign="top">Hope you enjoy the Bigma! It''s a fun lens if you''re willing to lug the beast. I''ve got the unstablized version, but still manage to take handheld shots at times.<br/>I think I like <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=987493" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/24486/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_987493.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/24486/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_987493.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/24486/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_987493.jpg"/></a> <br/>Reason being, I enjoy how the copilot is sprawled out. Same goes for this one<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=987505" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/24486/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_987505.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/24486/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_987505.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/24486/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_987505.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Hadn''t ever heard of this type of racing though- good shots.</td>', 'Hope you enjoy the Bigma! It''s a fun lens if you''re willing to lug the beast. I''ve got the unstablized version, but still manage to take handheld shots at times.I think I like  Reason being, I enjoy how the copilot is sprawled out. Same goes for this one  Hadn''t ever heard of this type of racing though- good shots.', '2011-12-08 03:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
