(6614184, 985714, 67237, '<td valign="top">I am glad this finished so well! It was my favorite. <br/>This is probably the first time there are two photos shot in that wonderful country in the first page. Mine was shot Downtown Varadero though. Huge congrats on the ribbon!!!</td>', 'I am glad this finished so well! It was my favorite. This is probably the first time there are two photos shot in that wonderful country in the first page. Mine was shot Downtown Varadero though. Huge congrats on the ribbon!!!', '2011-12-08 11:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6614185, 985951, 101702, '<td valign="top">Wow, I expected this to place much higher. I was one of the 2 people to give you a 10 !<br/> <br/>I''m not sure why others aren''t seeing what I see. Despite the glare of the sun, the model''s face is still really nicely lit. She is a stunner, and has a wonderful expression. The image just looks pure to me, and is difficult to acheive to this standard. I loved it.</td>', 'Wow, I expected this to place much higher. I was one of the 2 people to give you a 10 ! I''m not sure why others aren''t seeing what I see. Despite the glare of the sun, the model''s face is still really nicely lit. She is a stunner, and has a wonderful expression. The image just looks pure to me, and is difficult to acheive to this standard. I loved it.', '2011-12-08 11:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
