(6614968, 986165, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great capture, really good black and white conversion.  I think you''ll find at some point that it''s ok to crop out parts of the animal.  What would have bumped this up past a 6 is if there were sharp focus on the face.  I think that''s the first place people look when staring at an animal.  Overall, good job!</td>', 'Great capture, really good black and white conversion.  I think you''ll find at some point that it''s ok to crop out parts of the animal.  What would have bumped this up past a 6 is if there were sharp focus on the face.  I think that''s the first place people look when staring at an animal.  Overall, good job!', '2011-12-09 09:33:02.000000', NULL, 0),
