(6629183, 985605, 68586, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of space with the way the door (?) chops the picture into two unequal portions, one with the gentleman in it which is quite full and the larger section which is almost minimalist in content - yet clearly parts of the same scene. Yet the air of almost Zen like quiet is questioned by the heavy padlock and chain on the extreme left of the shot.<br/> <br/>Very interesting shot and well spotted.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting use of space with the way the door (?) chops the picture into two unequal portions, one with the gentleman in it which is quite full and the larger section which is almost minimalist in content - yet clearly parts of the same scene. Yet the air of almost Zen like quiet is questioned by the heavy padlock and chain on the extreme left of the shot. Very interesting shot and well spotted. ', '2011-12-31 10:12:39.000000', NULL, 0),
