(6657424, 985600, 43463, '<td valign="top">The scene is indeed very tranquil. Soft hues and soft focus. It is almost impressionistic especially in the trees. However, there is one spot that appears more in focus - the horse in front. When I look specifically at that one, the rest of the horses that appear behind it appear  staggered in depth. The effect is almost 3-D.</td>', 'The scene is indeed very tranquil. Soft hues and soft focus. It is almost impressionistic especially in the trees. However, there is one spot that appears more in focus - the horse in front. When I look specifically at that one, the rest of the horses that appear behind it appear  staggered in depth. The effect is almost 3-D.', '2012-01-28 22:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
